  "ruleText": "Tra 204.01 Scope. This part shall apply to receipt of petitions for declaratory rulings, disposition of the same, and providing notice of the ruling to the public and the regulated community.\n\nSource. #4174, eff 12-1-86; EXPIRED 12-1-90\n\nNew. #5563, eff 1-28-93, EXPIRED: 1-28-99\n\nNew. #7927-A, eff 7-26-03",
